# Mobile variant UX

When editing files under `**/components/ui/**/mobile/**`:

- Apply engineering foundations and `code/web/ui` first.
- Load `skills/code/web/ux/SKILL.md` and **`references/mobile/*`** (not desktop refs).
- Edge list entrance and clip-boundary: `references/mobile/navigation-motion.md`.
- Pickers and snap scrollers: `references/mobile/pickers-and-scrollers.md`.
- Overlays, press feedback, motion libs: `references/shared/*`.
- Unsure which viewport applies: `references/viewport-routing.md`.

UI structure and folder placement: paired `mobile-ui.mdc` + `components-ui-hierarchy.md`.
